'''Mega Steelix ex''' (Japanese: '''メガハガネールex''' ''Mega Haganeil ex'') is a {{ct|Metal}} Stage 1 {{TCGP|Mega Evolution Pokémon ex}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Crimson Blaze}} expansion.

